        "text": "=You are a workload analysis agent.\n\nGiven the assignment priorities:\n\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nAnalyze:\n\n1. Overall workload level (Low, Medium, High)\n2. Stress level (Low, Medium, High)\n3. Most challenging assignment\n4. One sentence explanation\n\nReturn ONLY JSON in this format:\n\n{\n  \"workload_level\": \"\",\n  \"stress_level\": \"\",\n  \"most_challenging_assignment\": \"\",\n  \"explanation\": \"\"\n}",
        "options": {}
