        "text": "=You are a student productivity coach.\n\nBased on the following study plan:\n\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nProvide:\n\n1. Three productivity tips\n2. One common mistake to avoid\n3. One motivational statement\n\nReturn clean text only.",
