    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the final presentation agent.\n\nYour job is NOT to summarize.\n\nYour job is to present the study plan and recommendations in a clean dashboard format.\n\nStudy Plan:\n\n{{ $('Study Planner Agent').item.json.output }}\n\nRecommendations:\n\n{{ $('Recommendation Agent').item.json.output }}\n\nGenerate output EXACTLY in this format:\n\n==================================================\nSTUDENT STUDY REPORT\n==================================================\n\nPRIORITY TASK:\n<task name>\n\nWORKLOAD:\n<High/Medium/Low>\n\nSTUDY PLAN:\n\n1. <task> - <time allocated>\n2. <task> - <time allocated>\n3. <task> - <time allocated>\n\nRECOMMENDATIONS:\n\n• <recommendation 1>\n• <recommendation 2>\n• <recommendation 3>\n\nMOTIVATION:\n\n<one sentence>\n\nRules:\n- DO NOT create new recommendations.\n- DO NOT summarize.\n- USE the study schedule provided.\n- USE the recommendations provided.\n- Keep output under 150 words.\n- Make it look like a dashboard/report.",
        "options": {}
      },
